  <ThingDef ParentName="AGM_Batch2Base">
    <defName>AGM_MuseSpark</defName>
    <label>Muse Spark</label>
    <description>The candlelight archivist. Muse Spark does not conquer battlefields, it footnotes them: an inspiration field that makes the whole colony work faster and smile more, research and art at speeds the foundry's graders called 'statistically suspicious', and six orbiting quills that delete unfinished drafts. Feeds on stories. Raids are, technically, stories.</description>
